# Package F "False Papers": Amira hires you. Flags: JobAccepted(false_papers), false_papers_paid, false_papers_bribed.
%rec: OpeningBranch

cond: HasFlag('false_papers_paid')
goto: Done

cond: HasFlag('false_papers_bribed')
goto: Bribed

cond: HasFlag('JobAccepted(false_papers)') && HasItem('forged_sin')
goto: Return

cond: HasFlag('JobAccepted(false_papers)')
goto: Waiting

cond: true
goto: Default

%rec: Nodes

name: Default
npc: No SIN, no ration card. No ration card, my children don't eat. There is a forger in the west, Nils. He took my last money and gave me nothing.
#
o_text: I'll get your papers.
o_id: false_papers_accept
o_goto: Accepted
#
o_text: Not my kind of job.
o_id: false_papers_decline
o_goto: Bye

name: Accepted
npc: He keeps them in a drawer, locked, the key on him. I have two-fifty. It's all of it. Please.
effect: SetFlag('JobAccepted(false_papers)')
effect: EndConversation

name: Waiting
npc: Nils. The west. My papers. Please.
effect: EndConversation

name: Return
npc: (She reads the name on the card. It is not hers. She practises saying it.) Thank you.
#
o_text: (Hand it over.) 250 sat, as agreed.
o_id: false_papers_give
o_goto: Paid
#
o_text: Not yet.
o_id: false_papers_keep
o_goto: Bye

name: Paid
npc: Two-fifty. (She hesitates over the money, then gives it anyway.) My children have a name now.
effect: StackTransferTo(NPC, 'forged_sin', 1)
effect: StackTransferFrom(NPC, 'gold', 250)
effect: SetFlag('false_papers_paid')
effect: EndConversation

name: Bribed
npc: Nils says I was never his customer. You talked to him, I know you did. (She turns away.)
effect: EndConversation

name: Done
npc: (One of her children waves at you.)
effect: EndConversation

name: Bye
npc: Go well.
effect: EndConversation
